 * office VPS pulls curated messages from the ops outbox.
 *
 * Pull, not push: the VPS gateway listens on localhost only and its admin
 * key can unlink WhatsApp, so it is never exposed. The relay calls in with
 * one shared secret (OPS_RELAY_SECRET) that can only read queued messages
 * and their photos, and report what it posted.
 *
 *   POST /api/ops-relay/claim   { limit? }                 → { messages: [...] }
 *   GET  /api/ops-relay/photo?ref=delivery:dlv_…           → image bytes
